---
/**
 * ProblemVisionSection - "The Problem" (The Gap) & Vision/Mission side-by-side cards.
 */
---

<div class="shell purpose-grid" id="vision">
  <article class="purpose-card reveal">
    <span class="purpose-icon purpose-icon-vision" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2 12s4-6 10-6 10 6 10 6-4 6-10 6S2 12 2 12Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
    </span>
    <div>
      <p class="section-kicker">THE GAP</p>
      <h2>Running a model locally is <em>not enough.</em></h2>
      <p>Product-grade <strong>local AI</strong> requires far more than weights on a device:</p>
      <ul class="problem-list">
        <li><strong>Runtime lifecycle:</strong> model management, compatibility & dynamic updates</li>
        <li><strong>Observability & telemetry:</strong> performance, latency & quality signals</li>
        <li><strong>Hardware adaptation:</strong> RAM/VRAM constraints & resident memory optimization</li>
        <li><strong>Developer ergonomics:</strong> unified APIs & intuitive user experience</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="purpose-card reveal">
    <span class="purpose-icon purpose-icon-mission" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 2v3M22 12h-3"/></svg>
    </span>
    <div>
      <p class="section-kicker">VISION & MISSION</p>
      <h2>A local-first AI infrastructure layer for <strong>real-world products</strong>.</h2>
      <p><strong>Vision:</strong> <em>Local AI</em> as the default compute substrate for <strong>privacy, sovereignty, and resilience</strong>.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;"><strong>Mission:</strong> Build fundamental <strong>infrastructure layers</strong> so builders can ship exceptional <em>privacy-first AI experiences</em>.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</div>

<style>
  .purpose-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-5);
    margin-top: var(--space-12);
  }

  .purpose-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-5);
    padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }

  .purpose-card h2 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2vw, 1.85rem);
    line-height: 1.18;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .purpose-card p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-small);
  }

  .purpose-icon {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .purpose-icon svg {
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 1.8;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .purpose-icon-vision { color: var(--accent-blue); background: #edf2ff; stroke: currentColor; }
  .purpose-icon-mission { color: var(--accent-teal); background: #eafaf8; stroke: currentColor; }

  .problem-list {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-small);
  }

  .problem-list li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .purpose-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 580px) {
    .purpose-grid { margin-top: var(--space-8); }
    .purpose-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
